# The animation view's own words. Placeholders ({ $name }) must stay; their order may change.

## The play button shown over an animation when the system asks for reduced motion. Its
## name, read by screen readers; { $name } is what the animation shows ("Dancing cat").
anim-play = Play animation
anim-pause = Pause animation
anim-play-named = Play animation: { $name }
anim-pause-named = Pause animation: { $name }
